{"3724690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PAEB", "steam_appid": 3724690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/6f6db27dfad54dcf6f9c25bb7c0e4d65.avif?t=1766247811\" width=996 height=205 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/aabfb152e17fb464669630a1a551ecc6.avif?t=1766247811\" width=500 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In PAEB, every match takes place on a newly assembled map made from different islands, structures, and zones. Routes, positions, and situations are constantly changing — no two games feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/eb0b3914144f43e7925f5d248c8b9e4b.avif?t=1766247811\" width=1200 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/1a75be044921d5d14d468a93215443ee.avif?t=1766247811\" width=500 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Weapons behave consistently and predictably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You’re not fighting your gun — you’re focusing on aim, movement, and decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The combat is fast, responsive, and satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/eb0b3914144f43e7925f5d248c8b9e4b.avif?t=1766247811\" width=1200 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/62c3e3b75e85c320cb4a894dec91c0de.avif?t=1766247811\" width=500 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Modules let you adjust weapon behavior to match how you prefer to play — stability, mobility, range, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No gimmicks. No confusing systems. Just straightforward customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/eb0b3914144f43e7925f5d248c8b9e4b.avif?t=1766247811\" width=1200 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/f0bdf4617abba8e3ce20e9728bb074a1.avif?t=1766247811\" width=500 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each map is built from handcrafted islands, buildings, and points of interest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Individual pieces may be familiar, but every combination is fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You never know what the next encounter will look like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/eb0b3914144f43e7925f5d248c8b9e4b.avif?t=1766247811\" width=1200 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/49419f4ffb17c0f92b2d55a29c73020c.avif?t=1766247811\" width=500 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meteor showers, anomalies, and hazardous zones can appear mid-match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They shift the flow of combat and reward players who adapt quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/eb0b3914144f43e7925f5d248c8b9e4b.avif?t=1766247811\" width=1200 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/3f0f0d5063ff5e62c2547706c08aa758.avif?t=1766247811\" width=500 height=68 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You’re ready to fight almost immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Encounters are frequent, downtime is minimal, and there’s always something happening around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/eb0b3914144f43e7925f5d248c8b9e4b.avif?t=1766247811\" width=1200 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/d439ffa188587acc75b6b73d227e6369.avif?t=1766247811\" width=500 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">PAEB is about exploring the unknown, adapting to new situations, and responding under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every match is a new route through a world that outpaces you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/eb0b3914144f43e7925f5d248c8b9e4b.avif?t=1766247811\" width=1200 height=90 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/6f6db27dfad54dcf6f9c25bb7c0e4d65.avif?t=1766247811\" width=996 height=205 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/aabfb152e17fb464669630a1a551ecc6.avif?t=1766247811\" width=500 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In PAEB, every match takes place on a newly assembled map made from different islands, structures, and zones. Routes, positions, and situations are constantly changing — no two games feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/eb0b3914144f43e7925f5d248c8b9e4b.avif?t=1766247811\" width=1200 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/1a75be044921d5d14d468a93215443ee.avif?t=1766247811\" width=500 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Weapons behave consistently and predictably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You’re not fighting your gun — you’re focusing on aim, movement, and decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The combat is fast, responsive, and satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/eb0b3914144f43e7925f5d248c8b9e4b.avif?t=1766247811\" width=1200 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/62c3e3b75e85c320cb4a894dec91c0de.avif?t=1766247811\" width=500 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Modules let you adjust weapon behavior to match how you prefer to play — stability, mobility, range, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No gimmicks. No confusing systems. Just straightforward customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/eb0b3914144f43e7925f5d248c8b9e4b.avif?t=1766247811\" width=1200 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/f0bdf4617abba8e3ce20e9728bb074a1.avif?t=1766247811\" width=500 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each map is built from handcrafted islands, buildings, and points of interest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Individual pieces may be familiar, but every combination is fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You never know what the next encounter will look like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/eb0b3914144f43e7925f5d248c8b9e4b.avif?t=1766247811\" width=1200 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/49419f4ffb17c0f92b2d55a29c73020c.avif?t=1766247811\" width=500 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meteor showers, anomalies, and hazardous zones can appear mid-match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They shift the flow of combat and reward players who adapt quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/eb0b3914144f43e7925f5d248c8b9e4b.avif?t=1766247811\" width=1200 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/3f0f0d5063ff5e62c2547706c08aa758.avif?t=1766247811\" width=500 height=68 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You’re ready to fight almost immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Encounters are frequent, downtime is minimal, and there’s always something happening around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724690/extras/eb0b3914144f43e7925f5d248c8b9e4b.avif?t=1766247811\" width=1200 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><spa